Description: VeltOS Snipping Tool, a Windows 11 style screenshot tool
 Print Screen or Windows + Shift + S dims the screen and offers the
 snipping modes of Windows 11's Snipping Tool: rectangle, window, full
 screen and freeform. The snip is copied to the clipboard, saved in
 Pictures/Screenshots and announced by a notification that opens it for
 markup (ballpoint pen, highlighter, eraser, crop, undo, save, copy).
 Windows + Print Screen saves the whole screen at once.
 .
 The screen is captured through KDE's Spectacle, which KWin allows to take
 screenshots.
